e28/uploads/origins/27ffaa84-f58e-43cf-b0df-d915a887de0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2664cca5d72e8a162479ae295b1d822, https://si.imgix.net/e63efe28/uploads/origins/27ffaa84-f58e-43cf-b0df-d915a887de0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d52ec1069756374ce1734f5865706656 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e63efe28/uploads/origins/27ffaa84-f58e-43cf-b0df-d915a887de0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3666f89fcfb77164e9959ac06b60024 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nskebでイラスト拝見して、とっても素敵だったのでリクエストいたします！\n\n●依頼\n猫屋敷クロを描いていただけると幸いです\nポーズや表情、背景などすべてお任せします！\n\n●参考画像(全身イラスト)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XY6bvLzEihYDD9jy3954xHkLWfQjEF6U?usp=sharing\n\n●用途\nTwitterのアイコンと動画のサムネイルに使用する予定です\n背景と分離できると嬉しいです！\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oicbudou/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/04e1eba8/uploads/origins/2b9f0034-29c6-4a47-97d0-b2aedeec17c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbd3125ad311957f7b8f348e9f3a3ff2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04e1eba8/uploads/origins/2b9f0034-29c6-4a47-97d0-b2aedeec17c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbd3125ad311957f7b8f348e9f3a3ff2, https://si.imgix.net/04e1eba8/uploads/origins/2b9f0034-29c6-4a47-97d0-b2aedeec17c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d0422e85fb3bfb5f0e6de84162b6b37 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04e1eba8/uploads/origins/2b9f0034-29c6-4a47-97d0-b2aedeec17c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3c31232909fd93bdf3b2fd46d8381c6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. You have very cute art! Please draw my VTuber Claire: https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FVmft2QX0AA3dUg?format=jpg&name=900x900. She is a weather witch (she controls clouds, rain, lightning, snow, etc.) and her hair is made out of clouds so it is very light and fluffy. She is kind and curious. \n\nCan you please draw her using weather magic? The pose is entirely up to you. I would like to have commercial rights to this piece of art please. Thank you for your time!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oicbudou/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f0e6434/uploads/origins/aed6b1f6-ccad-4d56-a7fe-4baeb2a692bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee1504a9893f14b540a24a66667c71c5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f0e6434/uploads/origins/aed6b1f6-ccad-4d56-a7fe-4baeb2a692bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee1504a9893f14b540a24a66667c71c5, https://si.imgix.net/2f0e6434/uploads/origins/aed6b1f6-ccad-4d56-a7fe-4baeb2a692bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e940155b486ba9641ba212959c9e50a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f0e6434/uploads/origins/aed6b1f6-ccad-4d56-a7fe-4baeb2a692bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adf7c6e1ab7b1f26201c39ee94a60ed9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hi! i really love your artwork, and i was wondering if you could please draw my character? expression, pose, and everything else is up to you :) thanks!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/01mnjtal6ji7\n\nhttps://sta.sh/01mnjtal6ji7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oicbudou/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6005aa5/uploads/origins/70b5b73b-291a-46e7-bc60-264b038c59dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d887374c935330015f5e2b900806b76d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6005aa5/uploads/origins/70b5b73b-291a-46e7-bc60-264b038c59dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d887374c935330015f5e2b900806b76d, https://si.imgix.net/b6005aa5/uploads/origins/70b5b73b-291a-46e7-bc60-264b03